WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.240 --> 00:00:05.219
VaynerNation, thank you so much for 
listening to THE PLANE PROJECT.

00:00:05.470 --> 00:00:09.120
I just want to give a huge shout out to serendipity if the

00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:14.000
Wi-Fi was not broken on my flight from Sweden 
to New York, this would have never happened.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.540
Kind of just got my work done.

00:00:16.540 --> 00:00:20.960
Sat and just started thinking and 
somehow got ridiculously inspired.

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:23.640
Please bear with me with the quality of the audio.

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:27.100
Obviously I was in the air and in that zone.

00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:30.640
I hope you enjoy this new kind of project concept.

00:00:30.660 --> 00:00:34.880
Just kind of almost like a rant album. 
I'm very proud of it.

00:00:34.880 --> 00:00:38.500
I have a funny feeling a lot of you will get 
tremendous value out of it.

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:43.460
For some reason I was able to dig a little deeper 
than normal with a lot of the content.

00:00:43.560 --> 00:00:54.740
I would love to know: which one was your favorite rant? Enjoy this, enjoy this, enjoy this! See ya! - GV.

